{title: Haal Kya Hai Dilon Ka}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Laxmikant Pyarelal}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Haal kya hai dilo ka na pucho sanam
[A#]Aapka [C]muskurana gazab [Dm]dha gaya
[Dm]Ek to mehfil tumhari hasin kam na thi
[A#]Us pe [C]mera tarana [Dm]gazab dha gaya
[Dm]Ab to lehraya [F]masti bhari chhanv me
[A#]Bandh lo [A]chahe ghunghru [Dm]mere paanv me
[Dm]Main behakta nahi tha magar kya karu
[A#]Aaj mausam [C]suhana gazab [Dm]dha gaya
[Dm]Har nazar uth [F]rahi hai tumhari taraf
[A#]Aur tumhari [A]nazar hai [Dm]hamari taraf
[Dm]Aankh uthana tumhara to phir theek tha
[A#]Aankh uthakar [C]jhukana gazab [Dm]dha gaya
[Dm]Mast aankhon ka [F]jaadu jo shaamil hua
[A#]Mera gana [A]bhi sun-ne [Dm]ke kaabil hua
[Dm]Jisko dekho wohi aaj behos hai
[A#]Aaj to [C]main deewana [Dm]gazab dha gaya
